ts are world-renowned celebrities, her father is a director, her mother is an actress, perhaps this is why she is so graceful, disciplined, and can be rarely seen upset. However, that is a mask she wears for her parents and for the media, her original personality is bright and mischievous. Mayuu also tried her hand in acting, but she has not performed on stage after her leg was injured during a recording of a TV show she starred in when she was 14. Since then she just tries to live a normal school life."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115128"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0cc29d195d6f4e3e817e09f43f8fe86aa113726f80fd95b1726c3d88376a1ecf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b915a997b67db50d44bd7a7011803493b199f0ac46c38dd59c8047ccd3462990.webp","width":180,"height":190,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115129","characterName":"白瀬 希","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115129"},"originalCharacterName":"白瀬 希","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1109"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"81"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"60"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"46"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac: Sagittarius"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Precise weight: 46.4 kg."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who has been living next door to Takuma all the time and has been attending the same school as him always. Some years they have been in the same class, but not all of the time. (For example, they are not in the same class in the game.) Nozomi is the one girl Takuma can easily talk to, they seem to be close friends who share a platonic relationship. Nozomi can be described as is hardworking, caring and kind, but also rather nosy. It seems that the feelings she bears for Takuma aren't necessarily just friendly..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115129"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a22e7fceacdeda8b0e305494e022fbcf351d378997e4cd908ccc55175f309cd7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ab/abdcf85c68f7c5ab86c13fdfb325ec22e8833b7b83fa977fd823200224fa3f79.webp","width":180,"height":190,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115130","characterName":"水元 雫香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115130"},"originalCharacterName":"水元 雫香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1223"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"45"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac: Capricorn"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A typical young lady whose parents used to be presidents of a large company. A year ago her father's company went bankrupt. As a result the whole Mizumoto family was forced to live in poverty."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to Shizuka being raised as a young lady, she was sheltered from the outside world. which rendered her to be severely ignorant, she knows nothing about sexual education and her wariness of strangers is almost zero. That has to be pretty dangerous..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c115130"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/08/0835ae3d1df13e633fa48d8e80f3bae6c320d8a2b401d3768d028ee4ee29742c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bb6b30d52de6f4377c3f392f8b4ef1faf1773228a221277d5a20a27bd8c9f0aa.webp","width":180,"height":190,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c115131","characterName":"樋口 ほたる","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c115131"},"originalCharacterName":"樋口 ほたる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"625"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"42"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Zodiac: Cancer"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Precise weight: 41.5 kg."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious girl who goes to the same school as Shin'ya."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hotaru doesn't seem know where she lives nor who her parents are, even though she's been with him for a long, long time. Sometimes she appears in front of